{"id":"649243","name":"豆面卷","author":"诗韵墨香","authorId":"10606182","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649243/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"土豆淀粉","amount":"30克"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄豆粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆沙","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"制作方法：糯米粉200克，糖30克，土豆淀粉30克，食材量好备用。","img":"images/649243/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"容器中加入适量清水，和软一点的面团。","img":"images/649243/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面团比较软，直接摊蒸屉上，大火上锅蒸15分钟。","img":"images/649243/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黄豆面适量，全程小火炒制，不停搅拌均匀。","img":"images/649243/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒熟金黄色，放凉备用。","img":"images/649243/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面团蒸熟，放一会凉了。面案撒适量熟豆粉，擀薄厚均匀长片。","img":"images/649243/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"均匀涂抹一层豆沙馅，把多余边缘切掉。","img":"images/649243/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"从一边卷起。","img":"images/649243/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用刀切小段，即可食用。","img":"images/649243/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/649243/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}